# Lecture 4 -- Monotone sequences and subsequences

These notes formalize Abbott §2.4 (monotone convergence theorem) and §2.5
(subsequences and Bolzano-Weierstrass). They develop the connection between
bounded monotone sequences and convergence, and extract convergent subsequences.

